    <briefdescription>
<para>Shows information about an SgNode (similar to pdf generator) </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><image type="html" name="NodeInfoWidget.jpg"></image>
</para><para>Shows following information about an SgNode:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Location Info if node is an SgLocatedNode</para></listitem><listitem><para>general Rose-RTI</para></listitem><listitem><para>Annotated (Metric-) Attributes</para><para>Usage: just call <ref refid="classNodeInfoWidget_1aa84f252b35694073e7a3e55baf171490" kindref="member">setNode()</ref> </para></listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>    </detaileddescription>
